==================================================
PHASE 16 — ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
==================================================

The implementation is complete only when these workflows work.

TEST 1:

User:
"Create a photorealistic mountain landscape at sunset."

Expected:
An actual generated landscape displayed in AAROHAN.

TEST 2:

User:
"Create a professional LinkedIn banner for a Business Intelligence expert."

Expected:
An actual generated banner in landscape format.

TEST 3:

User:
"Make this image brighter and change the background."

Expected:
An actual edited image using the uploaded image.

TEST 4:

User:
"Generate another version with a different color palette."

Expected:
A new image variation.

TEST 5:

User:
"Save this image to my library."

Expected:
Image metadata and image file are persisted.

TEST 6:

User:
"Generate a futuristic AI workspace."

Expected:
Chat automatically invokes the image-generation provider and returns the actual generated image.

==================================================
FINAL DEVELOPMENT RULES
==================================================

1. Preserve existing AAROHAN features.
2. Do not replace the custom Transformer.
3. Do not fabricate generated images.
4. Do not show fake generation progress.
5. Do not download large models without approval.
6. Keep local generation as the default.
7. Make external providers optional.
8. Optimize for 6GB GPU memory.
9. Keep image generation separate from the main chat inference process.
10. Test every workflow.
11. Document installation and setup.
12. Update the README only after implementation is verified.

IMPLEMENTATION ORDER:

Phase 1: Image Studio UI.
Phase 2: ComfyUI installation and health check.
Phase 3: Local model integration.
Phase 4: Actual text-to-image generation.
Phase 5: Image history and storage.
Phase 6: Chat integration.
Phase 7: Image editing.
Phase 8: Advanced optimization and testing.

Do not attempt all phases in a single uncontrolled operation.

FINAL OBJECTIVE:

AAROHAN must allow users to create, edit, explore, save and manage AI-generated images through a simple conversational interface.

AAROHAN IMAGE ENGINE — IMAGINE. CREATE. TRANSFORM.